5. Write a python program to input marks of 5 students.
for each student, the program should check whether the entered marks are valid or invalid. Marks are considered valid only if they are between 0 and 100. If the marks are invalid, the program should display "Invalid Marks skipped" and move to the next student without printing those marks'''
for i in range(1,6):
    marks = int(input("Enter marks:"))
    if marks<0 or marks>100:
        print("Invalid Marks skipped")
        continue
    print("Valid Marks:",marks)
